r-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage</strong><br>32GB eMMC 5.1</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Resolution</strong><br>4K \u00d7 2K Ultra HD @ 60FPS<br>12\u2011bit color depth</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>HDR Support</strong><br>Dolby Vision \u2022 HDR10 \u2022 HDR10+ \u2022 HLG</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Video Decoding</strong><br>AV1 \u2022 H.265 (HEVC)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Audio Decoding</strong><br>AAC \u2022 HE\u2011AAC \u2022 Dolby Digital Plus<br>Dolby Atmos (MS12)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Audio Output</strong><br>SPDIF (Optical) \u2022 AUX 3.5mm</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Video Output</strong><br>HDMI 2.1b (HDCP 2.3) \u2022 RCA</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless</strong><br>Wi\u2011Fi 6 (2.4GHz + 5GHz)<br>802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/ax (2T2R)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Bluetooth</strong><br>Bluetooth 5.2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wired LAN</strong><br>100 Mbps Ethernet</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Ports</strong><br>USB 2.0 \u00d7 2</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #059669; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Power Input</strong><br>DC 12V / 1A</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #64748b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Included in Box</strong><br>GX1 Google TV Streamer<br>Bluetooth Voice Remote (Numeric Keys)<br>Power Adapter \u2022 HDMI Cable \u2022 Manual</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">True 4K HDR \u2022 Wi\u2011Fi 6 \u2022 Dolby Vision &amp; Atmos \u2022 AV1 Ready</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary by configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
